          'Everything you need to know about accommodation, airport transfers, booking deadlines and travel tips can be found on our Travel & Accommodation page.',
      },
      {
        question: 'Will there be a welcome desk or check-in area?',
        answer:
          'A welcome desk will be available at the resort for guests who need assistance with entry details, transfers, or event questions.',
      },
      {
        question: 'What is the weather like in November?',
        answerHtml: `
          <p>November is one of the best times to visit Cancún, with warm temperatures, lower humidity and plenty of sunshine. Expect daytime temperatures of <strong>28–30°C (82–86°F)</strong> and evenings around <strong>22–24°C (72–75°F)</strong>.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">So we recommend packing:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>☀️ Light, breathable clothing</li>
            <li>😎 Sunglasses &amp; a hat</li>
            <li>🧴 Sunscreen</li>
            <li>👡 Comfortable sandals</li>
